{"id":"vod_sn_39191","vodId":"39191","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"棺姬嘉依卡第一季","name_cn":"棺姬嘉依卡第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3e10f4125b68d39e3fd13f3b5a706ed2.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在大陆历一六零四年，持续了三个世纪的漫长战争终于画上了终点，整片菲尔毕斯特大陆哀鸿遍野，满目疮痍。托鲁（间岛淳司 配音）和阿卡丽（原优子 配音）虽然没有血缘关系，却结为了义兄妹，两人相互扶持经历了残酷的战争，彼此之间结下了深深的羁绊。　　战后经济十分萧条，而托鲁又是一副得过且过大大咧咧的懒惰性格，虽然阿卡丽一直在艰难的维持家中的生计，但生活却并没有什么改善。终于，断粮的危机降临了，无奈之下，托鲁进入了森林想要找点吃的，然而，在那里，等待着他的却是一位名为嘉依卡（安济知佳 配音）的神秘银发少女，在他们相遇的那一刻，命运的齿轮开始了它的运转。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RYgLV66ztP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SLhQUJdvt61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CEXTyGVXhp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jMSRkXMsJP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y3z7qhp5wC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6ikrf4MRaw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/79AFDccArU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d6TSmcqHiA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rxjyBXYpam1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R67HxBuB4A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5zkDzs8hzy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KQPSJBrzpj1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:49.523Z"}